flowchart TD
    A([Employee / Sales person<br/>raises Pre-Travel Request]) -->|Submit| B{Business Head}
    B -->|Approve / revise budget| C{Managing Director}
    B -->|Send back| A
    B -->|Reject| X([Rejected])
    C -->|Approve| D[Travel Assistant<br/>books flight + hotel<br/>per Matrix of Authority]
    C -->|Send back| A
    C -->|Reject| X
    D -->|Booked| E([Employee travels])
    D -. advance .-> F1[Accountant<br/>pays travel advance]
    E -->|Expense statement<br/>+ bills attached| G{Business Head<br/>claim approval}
    G -->|Approve / edit line amounts| H{HR Head<br/>final approval}
    G -->|Send back| E
    H -->|Approve| I[Accountant<br/>voucher, advance adjustment,<br/>payment]
    H -->|Send back| E
    I --> J([Paid & Closed])
    classDef emp fill:#e5eefb,stroke:#1c5cab,color:#0f3d6e
    classDef appr fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b07800,color:#4a3300
    classDef done fill:#e3f5ec,stroke:#0f7b4a,color:#0f4a2e
    classDef bad fill:#fde4e2,stroke:#b3261e,color:#7a1812
    class A,E emp
    class B,C,G,H appr
    class D,I,F1 emp
    class J done
    class X bad
